{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"DrunkGraph Client API","description":"Public API consumed by the web/mobile client.\n\n## How to get a token\n\n1. Log in at [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)\n2. Visit [http://localhost:3000/api/proxy/token/debug](http://localhost:3000/api/proxy/token/debug)\n3. Copy the token string\n4. Click the **Authorize** lock icon above and paste it\n\n## Auth flow\n\n```\nBrowser → Next.js (BetterAuth session)\n        → /api/proxy/[...path]\n        → Spring API (JWT validated via FusionAuth JWKS)\n        → Neo4j\n```\n\nJWTs are RS256, issued by FusionAuth, validated via `/.well-known/jwks.json`. The browser never calls Spring directly — all requests go through the Next.js proxy which attaches the token from the session.\n\n## Graph model\n\n```\n(User)-[:LIKES {score}]->(Flavor)<-[:HAS_FLAVOR {intensity}]-(Drink)-[:SERVED_AT]->(Place)\n(User)-[:CONSUMED {rating, date}]->(Drink)\n```\n\n## Recommendation scoring\n\n```\nscore = (jaccard × 0.5) + (weighted_avg × 0.5) + price_bonus\n```\n\n- **Jaccard** — flavor set overlap: `|A ∩ B| / |A ∪ B|`\n- **Weighted avg** — `avg(user.score × drink.intensity)` over matched flavors\n- **Price bonus** — up to +0.20 if within budget, −0.30 if over\n","version":"0.0.1"},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:8080","description":"Generated server url"}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"paths":{"/api/users/me/tastes":{"get":{"tags":["user-handler"],"operationId":"getMyTastes","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"number","format":"double"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["user-handler"],"operationId":"addTaste","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TasteRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"/api/users/me/consumption":{"post":{"tags":["user-handler"],"operationId":"logConsumption","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ConsumptionRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"/api/users/me":{"get":{"tags":["user-handler"],"operationId":"getMe","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/User"}}}}}}},"/api/users/me/recommendations":{"get":{"tags":["recommendation-handler"],"operationId":"getRecommendations","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":10}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Recommendation"}}}}}}}},"/api/flavors":{"get":{"tags":["flavor-handler"],"operationId":"listFlavors","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Flavor"}}}}}}}},"/api/drinks":{"get":{"tags":["drink-handler"],"operationId":"listDrinks","parameters":[{"name":"search","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":0}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":20}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Drink"}}}}}}}},"/api/drinks/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["drink-handler"],"operationId":"getDrink","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Drink"}}}}}}},"/api/drinks/category/{category}":{"get":{"tags":["drink-handler"],"operationId":"listDrinksByCategory","parameters":[{"name":"category","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type"